name: ['Albino Troll', 'Aura of Silence', 'Black Knight', 'Dissipate', 'Drain Life', 'Fireslinger', 'Forbid', 'Mogg Fanatic', 'Soltari Priest', 'Spike Feeder', 'Wall of Blossoms', 'White Knight']
